# Agent-harness scaffolding: the coding harness installs its skills into the
# project directory (one dir per harness entry point, all symlinks to the
# same skill set). Not part of the theme, never committed, never read by the
# build. Exactly these paths — the theme's own src/, tools/, docs/, hooks/,
# share/, assets/ and upstream/ are the project and stay tracked.
.agents/
.claude/
.commandcode/
.hermes/
.kiro/
.pi/
skills/
skills-lock.json
